The short version of my current strategy (melee):  I've ranked every
non-artifact weapon and every non-foobane artifact at +0 enchantment
and basic skill.  The weakest weapons in the table are orcish short
sword and orcish spear (every character class is unrestricted in at
least one of spear and short sword).  I don't use restricted weapons
(role-playing reasons, even if a +7 Excalibur lands in my lap :-).  In
game circumstances (weapon enchantment, shield availibility, two-weapon
usage, etc.) adjust specific weapons away from the baseline.

For ranged attack, it's spells, dagger, bow, or crossbow (depending on
damage and mana availability).  I generally don't melee with non
artifact daggers.

